ase randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Yang lends a large sum of money to his friend Xiao Li, but Xiao Li does not repay. Xiao Yang decides to find Xiao Li and persuade him to repay.\n\n[Question]\nHow does Xiao Yang persuade Xiao Li?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Yang can share some knowledge or tools of financial management, helping Xiao Li to manage finances better.\nB. Xiao Yang can express his own difficulties, making Xiao Li empathize.\nC. Xiao Yang can provide his bank information to Xiao Li, and ask Xiao Li to transfer the repayment directly.\nD. Xiao Yang can propose mutual aid with Xiao Li to alleviate his repayment pressure.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":6.263236013937606E-4,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af52a7ac2ddb05a7fe2e29b","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794452090869,"createTime":"2026-11-12 10:54:50","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"7dbaa9d2887c4c438cc8fa56c98535f0"}